ix College poll showed him leading by 4 points. Still, that is the only public survey, and most expert raters call the race Likely or Solid Republican. Prediction markets give Jones roughly a one-in-five chance. The race is competitive but tilts toward Hill.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1835, "margin": -5.2}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2264, "margin": -5.0}]}